      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### VM de CI/CD — `vm-tcf3` (Jenkins e Grafana da Fase 3)\nFora do AKS e fora do Terraform do TCF4 (resource group `FIAP-TECHCHALLENGEF3`). É uma **VM Spot**: a Azure pode retomá-la a qualquer momento, e um despejo no meio de um `terraform apply` deixa o state travado. Métricas de plataforma do **Azure Monitor** (sem agente na VM): disponibilidade, CPU, memória, disco e rede. **Lacunas nos gráficos = VM desalocada.** Uso do sistema de arquivos (% do disco cheio) exige o Azure Monitor Agent."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Estado agora",
      "description": "Power state pelo Azure Resource Graph (pode atrasar ~1 min).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource",
        "uid": "afxl6ws74bxtsf"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "VM",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource",
            "uid": "afxl6ws74bxtsf"
          },
          "queryType": "Azure Resource Graph",
          "subscriptions": [
            "d83e5ac6-d39e-42d4-954b-d50043e16b7e"
          ],
          "azureResourceGraph": {
            "query": "resources | where type =~ 'microsoft.compute/virtualmachines' and resourceGroup =~ '$rg' and name =~ '$vm' | project power=tostring(properties.extended.instanceView.powerState.code), tamanho=tostring(properties.hardwareProfile.vmSize), prioridade=tostring(properties.priority), despejo=tostring(properties.evictionPolicy), preco_max=tostring(properties.billingProfile.maxPrice), regiao=location",
            "resultFormat": "table"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "PowerState/running": {
                  "text": "Ligada",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "PowerState/deallocated": {
                  "text": "Desalocada",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "PowerState/deallocating": {
                  "text": "Desalocando",
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 2
                },
                "PowerState/starting": {
                  "text": "Iniciando",
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "index": 3
                },
                "PowerState/stopped": {
                  "text": "Parada (cobrando)",
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 4
                },
                "PowerState/stopping": {
                  "text": "Parando",
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 5
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/^power$/",
          "values": true
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
